omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a7yOSRDM7EsQ7kNvwFWOXMb&_nc_oc=Adq7m6hReQGKSBKYFY_ugLNxxkyL-qok9KD14Bn2wgtB7p4X1V9PX9T4-DmYZ4ucF3U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_Xri97gDU3nzpCPfwdCcjGGTipja06nFcNcrSQCVjWWQ&oe=6A2C2434"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9xSF3bUQM-4Q7kNvwETqTvy&_nc_oc=AdrOd82UeGT7VatqBsLcR5WDQ46mTZIjkWud7Vw7sFKhWA6sogUiO48t0YrDCa4H0Sk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9F-WCu81kkdhuudROw8AaIcHE9FpL-d5CqdvHwEa5T9w&oe=6A2C2596"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CUOR0YkD2u4Q7kNvwHOVj9X&_nc_oc=AdrnTyqaVUZg1QaZ8mDJJOE6wUsaqo4URWsWl7mA2rv-9ZaxYKNYokfiPIedMGukEII&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8C8_UT8IprBg-G8oeZx5Q9pQE5c9eR-d_-EEQd45xk2A&oe=6A2C0277"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://